ondary)\"},\"children\":\"Click 'Download Resized Image' to export the new file.\"}]]}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"card\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"style\":{\"fontSize\":\"1.25rem\",\"marginBottom\":\"1rem\"},\"children\":\"Key Features\"}],[\"$\",\"ul\",null,{\"style\":{\"paddingLeft\":\"1.25rem\",\"display\":\"flex\",\"flexDirection\":\"column\",\"gap\":\"0.5rem\",\"fontSize\":\"0.9rem\",\"listStyleType\":\"square\"},\"children\":[[\"$\",\"li\",\"0\",{\"style\":{\"color\":\"var(--text-secondary)\"},\"children\":\"Aspect Ratio Locking: Automatically calculates height based on width to prevent stretching.\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"1\",{\"style\":{\"color\":\"var(--text-secondary)\"},\"children\":\"Percentage Presets: Quick scaling tools for half-size or quarter-size compression.\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"2\",{\"style\":{\"color\":\"var(--text-secondary)\"},\"children\":\"Instant Processing: Fast canvas scaling algorithms.\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"3\",{\"style\":{\"color\":\"var(--text-secondary)\"},\"children\":\"Privacy-Centric: Completely runs in the browser.\"}]]}]]}]]}],[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"className\":\"card\",\"style\":{\"backgroundColor\":\"var(--bg-primary)\",\"padding\":\"2.5rem\",\"marginBottom\":\"3.5rem\"},\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"style\":{\"fontSize\":\"1.75rem\",\"marginBottom\":\"1rem\"},\"children\":\"Quickly Resize Images to Custom Dimensions\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-muted\",\"style\":{\"fontSize\":\"1.05rem\",\"marginBottom\":\"1.5rem\"},\"children\":\"Whether you need to upload a profile photo, adjust graphics for a blog layout, or scale images for a presentation, having the correct pixel dimensions is essential. Our online Image Resizer allows you to scale images instantly right inside your browser window.\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"\\n<h3>Understanding Aspect Ratio and Why It Matters</h3>\\n<p>Aspect ratio is the proportional relationship between an image's width and its height. If you force an image to resize without keeping this proportion, it will stretch or squash. Keeping the aspect ratio locked preserves the natural aesthetics of portraits, landscape photos, and product graphics.</p>\\n\\n<h3>How to Prepare Images for Different Platforms</h3>\\n<p>Different web platforms require specific image sizes for optimal display:</p>\\n<ul>\\n  <li><strong>Blog Headers:</strong> Usually 1200px width for standard layouts.</li>\\n  <li><strong>Email Newsletters:</strong> Around 600px to 800px width to fit nicely on mobile email clients.</li>\\n  <li><strong>App Mockups:</strong> Exact aspect configurations depending on screen targets.</li>\\n</ul>\\n<p>Using our resizer, you can input these exact values in seconds, ensuring your graphics load correctly without pixelation.</p>\\n    \"},\"style\":{\"fontSize\":\"0.95rem\",\"color\":\"var(--text-secondary)\",\"lineHeight\":\"1.75\",\"display\":\"flex\",\"flexDirection\":\"column\",\"gap\":\"1.25rem\"}}]]}],\"$L22\",\"$L23\"]}]}]\n20:[\"$\",\"footer\",null,{\"className\":\"Footer_footer__eNA9m\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"container\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"Footer_grid__WCfx6\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"Footer_brandCol__6UIwg\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L8\",null,{\"href\":\"/\",\"className\":\"Footer_logo__8uCHD\",\"aria-label\":\"Creators Units - Go to homepage\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"svg\",null,{\"className\":\"Footer_logoIcon__WWDSF\",\"viewBox\":\"0 0 24 24\",\"fill\":\"currentColor\",\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"rect\",null,{\"x\":\"3\",\"y\":\"3\",\"width\":\"8\",\"height\":\"18\",\"rx\":\"2\"}],[\"$\",\"rect\",null,{\"x\":\"13\",\"y\":\"3\",\"width\":\"8\",\"height\":\"8\",\"rx\":\"2\"}],[\"$\",\"rect\",null,{\"x\":\"13\",\"y\":\"13\",\"width\":\"8\",\"height\":\"8\",\"rx\":\"2\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"Footer_logoText__SzK4_\",\"children\":\"Creators Units\"}]]}],[\